        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n3.I wanted to know if the statute enables the revenue authority to seal the petitioner's premises."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a22f4987f7b84b0b851737ebcf08e0c3_14",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "My attention has not been drawn to any such statutory power."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7cab838d536e4e2aa596cbdccd715d15_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nhttps://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 4.The learned Government Advocate however submitted that the authority resorted to the act of sealing only for the purpose of storing the seized goods."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2eb1e23a1b56442ca58d3e84917b70f1_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "5.The object of the authority may be in order."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "76ac1d02bbe44654ab4ca27830a2a860_17",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "But that will not validate an action that is otherwise illegal and without jurisdiction."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a623ccee2365424ebaa123e2bc7f8787_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In fact, Section 38 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 would call upon the owner of the premises to assume responsibility for the seized materials."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0d4146b4bb924663882c2b2b72f3bb4b_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "A similar approach can very well be adopted in this case also."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "21c6ad75d2e64a6fbf33b03383259a9f_20",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "An inventory can be taken and the petitioner can be made responsible for the safe and proper custody of the seized crackers."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d649af07653e4b2f884bd2e435d7e4da_21",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6.The second respondent and the petitioner shall co-ordinate between themselves on 08.06.2024 in the forenoon in this regard."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9be0e18369da4accac0ad62e549b054d_22",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is open to the second respondent to videograph and photograph the seized material."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f1467eea0deb40699554d5a11eff9147_23",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The petitioner shall undertake to keep safe custody of the seized material and make it available as and when the prosecution demands."
